{"_id":"68a7360d8ec3d8323af125a1","nodeId":"Ke522R-4k6TDeiDRyZbbU","roadmapSlug":"backend","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:53.149Z","description":"# Monolithic Apps\n\nMonolithic applications are single, cohesive units with tightly integrated components running as one service. Simplifies development and deployment but creates scalability and maintainability challenges. Changes require full system redeployment. Suitable for smaller applications; larger ones often transition to microservices.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Pattern: Monolithic Architecture","url":"https://microservices.io/patterns/monolithic.html","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb45f1"},{"type":"article","title":"Monolithic Architecture - Advantages & Disadvantages","url":"https://datamify.medium.com/monolithic-architecture-advantages-and-disadvantages-e71a603eec89","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb45f2"},{"type":"video","title":"Monolithic vs Microservice Architecture","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NdeTGlZ__Do","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb45f3"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T07:26:50.654Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04ddfb5fcb94d04169db","title":"Scrimba - Backend Developer Career Path","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"http://scrimba.com/the-backend-developer-path-c0tbi0l98f?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/backend/content/Ke522R-4k6TDeiDRyZbbU.md"}